# ==============================================================================
# SVARIO WEB — FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (STAGE 1)
# Copy this file to apps/web/.env.local for local development.
# NEVER put SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY or SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET in this file!
